! Memory-stage scout: Stage-Scout: Lares (Tasked Spirit), 2026-10-31

Source marks: [READ] opened this session. [SEARCH] search-result snippet only, page not opened. [RECALL] testimony from the scout's training memory, not re-verified today; the controller should treat it as testimony and check before quoting. WebFetch was not used; every web claim is [SEARCH] or [RECALL].

